IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPLITFUSE-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 PROMPT-LEN          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DECODE-BATCH        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TARGET-CHUNK        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 FUSED-CHUNKS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPLITFUSE-V2.
    IF TARGET-CHUNK == 0
        MOVE 512 TO TARGET-CHUNK.
    END-IF.

    MOVE PROMPT-LEN TO FUSED-CHUNKS.
    DIVIDE TARGET-CHUNK INTO FUSED-CHUNKS.
    IF FUSED-CHUNKS == 0
        MOVE 1 TO FUSED-CHUNKS.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 FUSED-CHUNKS.
    WEIGHT 30 DECODE-BATCH.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
